src/main/resources/db/migration/V24__claim_due_by.sql:1:-- A claim's due-by is fixed when it is added: its date plus the terms of its person's grade in force on that date
src/main/resources/db/migration/V44__claim_business_day_terms.sql:1:-- A claim's due-by now counts business days: it is the terms-th day after the date it counts from that is not a
src/main/resources/db/migration/V44__claim_business_day_terms.sql:3:-- it). Each claim keeps the date its due-by counts from (its date when it was added: a later change to the date leaves
src/main/resources/db/migration/V44__claim_business_day_terms.sql:5:-- date, with the days their fixed due-by lay after it as their terms.
